# power on -> Four Swords menu -> A Link to the Past: register a name (A, START to END, A), skip nothing in the intro
# (mashing A through the story and the castle scenes), wake up in Link's house, walk out into the rain on the field,
# then L opens the world map (LTTP-1). Worked out in the harness (frame counts there match).
wait 240
hold START 4
wait 40
hold START 4
wait 40
hold A 4
wait 40
hold A 4
wait 300
hold START 6
wait 60
hold A 6
wait 60
hold START 6
wait 60
hold A 6
wait 200
hold A 6
wait 90
hold A 6
wait 90
hold A 6
wait 200
shot a-filemenu
# the story and scenes (about 10800 frames of A, every 15th)
mash A 720 15
shot b-house
hold A 3
wait 30
hold DOWN 80
hold LEFT 40
hold DOWN 120
hold RIGHT 90
hold DOWN 100
wait 100
hold LEFT 30
hold DOWN 100
wait 200
shot c-field
hold DOWN 60
wait 100
shot d-field2
hold L 20
wait 120
shot e-map
wait 120
shot e-map2
press L 6
wait 60
shot f-closed
hold RIGHT 90
shot g-walk
hold UP 60
wait 60
shot h-walk2
